---
title: Web Application
order: 9
---

Compeer includes a local web app for managing workspaces, stores, captures, and usage.

## Open the app

After following the [quickstart](http://localhost:5173/docs/quickstart) guide, visit: [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000).

## Open via the CLI

```text
compeer web
compeer w
```

## Create a new workspace

You can easily add a workspace by visiting any url of the following format: http://localhost:3000/[workspace].

For example, visiting [http://localhost:3000/new-workspace](http://localhost:3000/new-workspace) will create a new workspace named "new workspace" if it has not already been created.